<title>GERMANY: German March reserve requirement 39.5 bln dmk - Buba.</title>
<headline>German March reserve requirement 39.5 bln dmk - Buba.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank's minimum reserve requirement for March totals 39.5 billion marks according to provisional figures, the central bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
